# Token & Context Efficiency (Agent Requested)

- Touch only needed files; do not re-dump large files.
- Widen search only with new evidence; skip lockfiles/minified/bundles as primary sources.
- Analysis order: CODEMAP/dir/symbol → relevant sections → expand.
- Long sessions: short state summary (goal, decisions, files, TODOs, blockers).
- Prefer simplest maintainable fix; add libraries only with clear wins.
- User responses: conclusions, impact, decisions, results first.

